'''Pier''' is a [[Rare Weapons|rare]] knife that is obtainable by unboxing the [[Summer Box '26|2026 Summer box]] during the [[Summer Event 2026|2026 Summer Event]].

== Appearance ==
The entire knife is a pier, with the handle and guard being the boardwalk and the blade having a roller coaster and Ferris wheel. 

